    "text": "By Nick Roesch ,\n1 days ago The Kansas City Chiefs are looking to get off to a dominant 3-0 start in 2026. They will have to knock off the Miami Dolphins in Week 3 to do so. The Dolphins are 0-2, but Sunday is their home opener and they will be desperate to not fall to 0-3. It’s a game the Chiefs should win, but they can’t take Miami lightly. Read full article",
